# Per-Dockerfile ignore for web/Dockerfile (build context is the repo ROOT).
# Paths are relative to the context root. Without this, `COPY web/ ./` in the
# build stage would pull the HOST's web/node_modules + web/.next over the clean,
# in-image `pnpm install` from the deps stage — contaminating the build with
# host-built (glibc) artifacts and diverging from the release, which builds from
# a clean checkout. Keep this in sync with what the release workflow expects.
.git
**/node_modules
web/.next
